[03:29.10] The softest thing on the universe
[03:31.82] Overcomes the hardest thing in the universe.
[03:36.78] That without substance can enter where there is no room.
[03:44.68] Hence I know the value of non-action.
[03:48.44] Teaching without words and work without doing
[03:51.76] Are understood by very few.
